The second item tests that recording a version is a separate act from saving
a file (\cref{sec:model}).
The key distractor is the commit-as-save conflation---that saving the file has
already stored the version---which repository-data studies find students hold,
treating the system as file storage \autocite{Cochez2013DVCSUsage}.

