\subsubsection{Branches}

The sixth item tests that a branch is a movable pointer into the commit graph,
not a place you move into (\cref{sec:branches}).
The key distractor is the branch-as-directory misconception---trying to
[[cd]] into a branch---the best-documented Git misconception in the literature
\autocite[Sec.~5.2]{IsomottonenCochez2014}; switching a branch instead
repoints the working tree in place.

